  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.85</data>
  <data key="d36">A drop in crude exports from the Middle East tightens feedstock availability for refiners worldwide, raising refined-fuel scarcity and pushing up global fuel prices.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">middle_east_maritime_con</data>
