  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Faster rerouting of fuel and related maritime shipments increases transit times, insurance and freight costs on major trade lanes, raising landed costs for imported vehicles and reducing their competitive market share in the region.</data>
