  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Faster and more extensive fuel rerouting increases logistics and energy costs for data centers, chip fabs and transport‑heavy supply chains, degrading margins and pressuring market valuations of AI infrastructure providers.</data>
