  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">An increase in import market share (i.e., more open access to China/EU vehicle markets) reduces perceived policy and market‑access risk for foreign investors in adjacent tech sectors, lowering their risk aversion toward cross‑border AI and infrastructure investments.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
