  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.85</data>
  <data key="d36">An increase in imported-vehicle market share raises volumes of finished cars and components moved from Asia/other producing regions to Europe, directly increasing container/RoRo vessel transits through major chokepoints (e.g., Suez, Bab el-Mandeb).</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">china_eu_industrial_riva</data>
  <data key="d39">middle_east_maritime_con</data>
