  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">A surge in policymakers' rate of proposing and implementing industrial/trade controls builds customs/export‑control capacity and legal authorities that are immediately redeployed to tighten monitoring, compliance and penalties for sanctions breaches related to Russia.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">china_eu_industrial_riva</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
</edge>
