<edge source="us_political_alliance_st::party_cohesion_level" target="china_eu_industrial_riva::policy_response_momentum" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Stronger bipartisan cohesion in the US enables rapid, unified executive and legislative moves (e.g., sanctions, export controls) that create diplomatic momentum and normative cover for EU policymakers to accelerate similar industrial policy responses.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
