  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">High cohesion within a governing party allows rapid passage and sustained implementation of industry‑friendly measures (subsidies, procurement, tax incentives) that mobilize public and private funding into AI projects.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_political_alliance_st</data>
  <data key="d39">global_ai_market_cycle</data>
</edge>
