  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">A sustained uptick in regulatory scrutiny leads agencies to open formal investigations and enforcement actions that generate new lawsuits, prosecutions, and legal challenges implicating political actors and policy decisions.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">global_ai_market_cycle</data>
  <data key="d39">us_political_alliance_st</data>
