  <data key="d36">A rise in investor risk aversion triggers a cross‑market flight to safety and liquidity withdrawal from commodity and shipping markets, increasing bid‑ask spreads and the premium demanded for bearing geopolitical and supply risks in energy and shipping.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
