  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.55</data>
  <data key="d36">A sustained decline in infrastructure firm valuations typically produces earnings shocks, layoffs and congressional inquiries that increase media attention on industry–politics ties and oversight failures (i.e., higher scrutiny when the index falls).</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">global_ai_market_cycle</data>
  <data key="d39">us_political_alliance_st</data>
</edge>
