  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.65</data>
  <data key="d36">Rising flows of capital into AI create resources for corporate lobbying, PAC contributions, and funded advocacy that bolster allied politicians' influence and access within policymaking arenas.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">global_ai_market_cycle</data>
